TITLE Mix 50 mmol/kg DIC with 50 mmol/kg Ca, 1:1, heat 20 to 200C, calcite eq
SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca   50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 10
END

USE solution 10
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 10
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 10
    20 200 in 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp calcite_moles
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, EQUI("Calcite")
END
